  "title": "Datadog US1 - Delayed Processes data",
  "text": "Service: Datadog US1\nIncident: Delayed Processes data\nStatus: resolved\nImpact: minor\nStarted: 2026-08-06T14:51:32.504-04:00\nResolved: 2026-08-06T15:37:32.874-04:00\nUpdates:\n- 2026-08-06T15:37:32.874-04:00: resolved - This incident has been resolved.\n- 2026-08-06T15:27:17.409-04:00: monitoring - A fix has been implemented and we are monitoring the results.\n- 2026-08-06T15:18:03.199-04:00: identified - The issue has been identified and a fix is being implemented.\n- 2026-08-06T14:51:32.613-04:00: investigating - We are investigating increased latency processing Processes data.\n\nAs a result of this issue, some users may see delays or gaps for data based on Live Process Monitoring.\n\nTo prevent false monitor alerts due to delayed data, monitors affected by the delay will not notify and will automatically resume once current data is available. All other monitors will operate normally.",
